# Atlas Bible — data payload policy
#
# data/raw/ holds acquired third-party datasets (~120 MB). Payloads are NOT committed:
# they are reproducible from the URLs and checksums recorded in each PROVENANCE.md.
#
# PROVENANCE.md files ARE committed, always. They are the licence and integrity record
# for every byte of content that ships, and must survive independently of the payloads.

raw/**
!raw/
!raw/*/
!raw/**/PROVENANCE.md
